IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCOUNTREAD.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.

    SELECT ACCOUNT-DETAILS
    ASSIGN TO 'BankingApp/Files/ACCOUNT-DETAILS'
    ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
    ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
    RECORD KEY IS ACCOUNT-NO
    FILE STATUS IS WS-FILE-STATUS.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.

    FD ACCOUNT-DETAILS.
    01 ACCOUNT-DETAILS-RECORD.
        05 ACCOUNT-NO PIC 9(10).
        05 ACCOUNT-PIN PIC 9(4).
        05 BALANCE PIC 9(6).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

    01 WS-FILE-STATUS PIC XX.
    01 WS-EOF PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    OPEN INPUT ACCOUNT-DETAILS

    IF WS-FILE-STATUS NOT = '00'
        DISPLAY 'ERROR OPENING ACCOUNT DETAILS'
        DISPLAY 'FILE STATUS: ' WS-FILE-STATUS
        STOP RUN
    END-IF

    DISPLAY 'ACCOUNT-NO. PIN   BALANCE'
    
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'

        READ ACCOUNT-DETAILS

        AT END
            MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
        NOT AT END
            DISPLAY ACCOUNT-NO '  ' ACCOUNT-PIN '  ' BALANCE
        END-READ

    END-PERFORM

    CLOSE ACCOUNT-DETAILS
STOP RUN.
